1784347781.882 RX Newhaven, Adventurer's Guild
1784347781.882 RX     This nicely crafted room is well furnished and decorated with things that
1784347781.882 RX you have never seen before, from strange exotic weapons, to swirling vials of
1784347781.882 RX liquid. A well toned man, stands in front of a practice mat with his arms
1784347781.882 RX crossed. He stands up lightly at your approach, looks you up and down, and
1784347781.882 RX breaks into a lopsided grin. 
1784347781.883 RX Obvious exits: south
