1784347810.337 RX Newhaven, Narrow Road
1784347810.337 RX     This narrow road is quite plain save for the various lanterns hanging from
1784347810.337 RX the trees around, and a large stone stairwell leading downwards. You hear the
1784347810.337 RX clash of steel below you, and cries of pain and triumph accompanying it. Stone
1784347810.337 RX buildings lie to your north and west. 
1784347810.337 RX Obvious exits: north, east, west, down
