1784347815.044 RX Newhaven, Village Entrance
1784347815.044 RX     Welcome to Newhaven! You are standing at the crude wooden gates of the
1784347815.044 RX village entrance, in the middle of a dusty path. A low wooden palisade
1784347815.044 RX surrounds the village, to protect against creatures of the night and random
1784347815.044 RX raiders. You can see small buildings to the north and south, and a dusty path
1784347815.044 RX that leads to the west and southeast. 
1784347815.069 RX You notice large sign, newbie manual here.
1784347815.070 RX Obvious exits: north, south, west, southeast
