1784352548.322 RX Beach's End
1784352548.322 RX     This is a gravelly beach, curving around the sheer rock face to the north.
1784352548.322 RX Bits of shell and bone litter the beach, and if there is any plant life, you
1784352548.322 RX certainly cannot find it. In fact, there is a noticeable lack of life signs
1784352548.322 RX throughout this whole area, and you get the feeling that even the animals that
1784352548.322 RX may have inhabited this island have abandoned it. The rock face cuts off the
1784352548.322 RX beach here, but you spy a small path leading through a large crack. 
1784352548.322 RX Obvious exits: southwest
