1784352564.434 RX     This is a gravelly beach bordering a small, sheltered lagoon. Off across
1784352564.434 RX the raging river, you can see the port-side of the city of Silvermere. The
1784352564.434 RX beach continues off to the east and west, curving around the sheer rock face
1784352564.434 RX which towers above you. 
