1784352568.547 RX The Silver River, Silvermere Docks
1784352568.550 RX     The rapid currents of the river make it perilous to travel, even in a
1784352568.550 RX suitable vessel, as it is filled with strange water-dwellers. The shimmering
1784352568.550 RX silvery surface of the water gives the river its namesake. To the north, you
1784352568.550 RX can see the gravelly beach of a large island poking out of the middle of the
1784352568.550 RX river, and to the south, the seldom-used port of Silvermere. The river flows
1784352568.550 RX quickly downstream to the west, and upstream to the east. 
1784352568.550 RX You notice 500 gold crowns here.
1784352568.550 RX Obvious exits: north, south, east, west
